[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_04]
Muffin!

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_04_desc]
Derpy Hooves’ Decree #42: Everypony in Cloudsdale has the right to eat muffins for breakfast!\nDerpy Hooves’ Decree #43: Everypony in Cloudsdale has the right to eat muffins for breakfast with blueberry jam!\nDerpy Hooves’ Decree #44: Everypony in Cloudsdale has the obligation to eat muffins for breakfast without swamp flower honey jam!

[en.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_04_TOOLTIP]
Derpy Hooves is thinking about stability, but what exactly she is thinking about, we will never know.

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_04]
马芬！

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_04_desc]
呆蹄领主第42号法令：每只云中城的小马都有权利早餐吃马芬！\n呆蹄领主第43号法令：每只云中城的小马早餐吃马芬的时候都有权利配蓝莓酱！\n呆蹄领主第44号法令：每只云中城的小马早餐吃马芬的时候都有义务不配沼地花蜜酱！

[zh.FOCUS_C03_MUFFIN_04_TOOLTIP]
呆蹄在思考关于维持稳定的问题，但是她究竟在想什么，我们永远不会知道。

